Components

1. Min-Heap Index
2. Scheduler   

AckLevel: Timestamp to which the job has been executed
ReadLevel: Timestamp to which the job has been loaded into memory on the min-Heap


All time stamp will be stored or tranformed from any timestamp format to RFC3339

V0.0.1 - Release Scope
    1. Only support for One time job
    2. Focus on building the core job-scheduler logic
    3. Setting up the required CI pipeline
        a. AI Review Bot for PR - Done
        b. Test and Build pipeline
    4. Branch rules
        a. PR must be reviewed by at least 2 reviewers
        b. PR must pass all the tests before merging    
    5. Release pipeline and documentation
        a. Using tag based release, where the tag will be in format v0.0.1, v0.0.2 and so on
        b. Generate release notes using AI based on the merged PRs since last release
    6. No Database integration in this release, all data will be stored in memory